  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة الضحى مكتوبة بخط كبير: 11 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة الضحى مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 11، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة الضحى</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093001.mp3');\">وَالضُّحَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093002.mp3');\">وَاللَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093003.mp3');\">مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093004.mp3');\">وَلَلْآخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ الْأُولَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093005.mp3');\">وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093006.mp3');\">أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًا فَآوَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093007.mp3');\">وَوَجَدَكَ ضَالًّا فَهَدَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093008.mp3');\">وَوَجَدَكَ عَائِلًا فَأَغْنَىٰ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093009.mp3');\">فَأَمَّا الْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [9]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093010.mp3');\">وَأَمَّا السَّائِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [10]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/093011.mp3');\">وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الضحى [11]</span></div></div></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
